  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Upper design draws inspiration from human anatomy\nBreathable mesh, textile and real and synthetic leather upper\nClassic laces\nFoam midsole\nVisible Max Air unit\nDurable rubber outsole with flex grooves\nReflective tongue and heel\nThe Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes are imported.\nStep into a certified sneaker classic when you wear the Big Kids' Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes. This sneaker has design lines inspired by human anatomy and visible Max Airs unit for cushioned steps you can see.﻿</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Big Kids' Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grade School</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Neon Yellow/Anthracite/Light Graphite</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3294084</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Grade School - Kids')</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">